></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->allows you to manage multiple orders from eBay, Amazon, Etsy, Shopify and more. It&#39;s easy to set up - just follow our guide on <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/our-services/bulk-send" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->how to send multiple parcels and connect your Evri account<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->With over 9,000+ ParcelShops, 24/7 Lockers as well as Courier collection options, it&#39;s just as easy to drop off your parcels too!<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="canevrideliverinternationalparcels-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-canevrideliverinternationalparcels" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-canevrideliverinternationalparcels" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Can Evri deliver international parcels?-open answer" data-test-id="canevrideliverinternationalparcels-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="canevrideliverinternationalparcels-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Can Evri deliver international parcels?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-canevrideliverinternationalparcels" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-canevrideliverinternationalparcels" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="canevrideliverinternationalparcels-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Yes - whether you’re sending parcels within the UK, <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><a href="/our-services/international-courier-services/europe" rel="noreferrer"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Europe<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, or further afield, our global network gives you speedy and reliable <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><a href="/our-services/international-courier-services" rel="noreferrer"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->international Courier services<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> all over the world to 200+ destinations.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="howreliableisevristracking-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-howreliableisevristracking" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-howreliableisevristracking" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-How reliable is Evri’s tracking?-open answer" data-test-id="howreliableisevristracking-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="howreliableisevristracking-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>How reliable is Evri’s tracking?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-howreliableisevristracking" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-howreliableisevristracking" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="howreliableisevristracking-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our tracking system gives you regular updates to follow your parcel from start to finish. Check your parcel any time and choose to divert delivery around your plans with our easy to use tracking tool. From customers to our clients’ customers, we make sure your parcel journey is stress-free and simple every step of the way. Simply enter your tracking number on our <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><a href="/track-a-parcel" rel="noreferrer"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->tracking page<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> to see where your parcel is on its journey.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="canibuycoverformyparcel-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-canibuycoverformyparcel" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-canibuycoverformyparcel" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Can I buy cover for my parcel?-open answer" data-test-id="canibuycoverformyparcel-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="canibuycoverformyparcel-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Can I buy cover for my parcel?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-canibuycoverformyparcel" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-canibuycoverformyparcel" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="canibuycoverformyparcel-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Yes - we include cover up to £20 on almost all* items for FREE. If your item is worth more, you can add extra cover up to the value of £999. For more information about parcel cover, see <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/parcel-cover" rel="noreferrer" target="_self"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->our guide<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Prohibited items and <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/our-services/postable" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Postable parcels<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> aren’t covered, and there are certain items you can send that are excluded from this option too. Check our *<!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><a href="/send/what-i-can-and-cannot-send" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->non-compensation list<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->for a full breakdown of what these include.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="canigetabusinessaccount-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-canigetabusinessaccount" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-canigetabusinessaccount" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Can I get a business account?-open answer" data-test-id="canigetabusinessaccount-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="canigetabusinessaccount-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Can I get a business account?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b d